      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在目白阿尔丹的管家婆婆的带领下，\n我来到了疗养设施旁边的树林，\n目白阿尔丹正在那里做森林浴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d034880e086d2cfd91990a5191e3fd8ca926e995b7063a77a84df322fd50d24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071114.json",
      "json_path": [
