      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你明白我刚才说的那些话……\n意味着什么吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9675da999ea67e6cbcadc3f8e9da500e0e9a94b37382102e81923ade1d21cfda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
